evidence.text:
The following information is provided pursuant to Rule 13e-4:

- The Company has received the final results of the Offer, which expired at 11:59 p.m., New York City Time, on January 21, 2026;

- The Company has accepted for purchase pursuant to the Offer approximately 4,180,330 Shares at a purchase price per Share equal to the net asset value per Share as of December 31, 2025, of which Share amount includes an additional 1,471,222 Shares for which the Company reserved in the Offer to Purchase the right to purchase;

- The number of Shares that the Company has accepted for purchase in the Offer represents approximately 4.456% of the total number of Shares outstanding as of December 31, 2025;

- Payment of the purchase price for the Shares was made in the form of non-interest bearing, non-transferrable promissory notes issued to the Stockholders whose tenders were accepted for purchase by the Company in accordance with the terms of the Offer; and

- On January 29, 2026, the Company determined that as of December 31, 2025, the net asset value per Share was $18.82 per Share, resulting in an aggregate purchase price of approximately $78,673,802 for approximately 4,180,330 Shares validly tendered and not withdrawn, which amount will be paid by the Company pursuant to the terms of the promissory notes.
